#: personalstats/templates/personalstats/dc_charge.html:370
msgid ""
"Tip: switch Envelope to Min / max to get day-map links for the samples that "
"form the band edges."
msgstr ""
"Tipp: Hüllkurve auf Min / Max stellen, um Tageskarten-Links für die "
"Bandkanten zu erhalten."

#: personalstats/templates/personalstats/dc_charge.html:375
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Only Supercharging / CCS-style sessions (peak ≥ ~40 kW, or flagged fast charger) are used —\n"
"    home AC and destination charging are excluded. The first ~2 minutes of each session (and any\n"
"    early sample still far below that session’s peak) are dropped so Supercharger power-ramp\n"
"    samples do not pull the curve down. Robust filter further drops sessions with unusually low\n"
"    peak power (typical of V2 stall sharing) and cold / unpreconditioned crawls. V3 vs V4 stalls\n"
"    are not separated: the car caps at its max power either way.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Nur Supercharge-/CCS-Sitzungen (Spitze ≥ ~40 kW oder markierter Fast Charger) —\n"
"    Heim-AC und Destination entfallen. Die ersten ~2 Minuten jeder Sitzung (und frühe Proben\n"
"    noch weit unter der Session-Spitze) werden weggelassen, damit der Supercharger-Hochlauf\n"
"    die Kurve nicht nach unten zieht. Der robuste Filter entfernt zusätzlich niedrige Spitzen\n"
"    (V2-Sharing) und Kaltstarts. V3/V4 werden nicht getrennt.\n"
"    "

